t <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T08:09:24-07:00","id":1385605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385415-ysyr-fan-write-ups?p=1385542#post1385542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While it's not a write up, this <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?472239-Choose-Your-Own-Adventure-Exalted-Setting-Edition\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Choose Your Own Adventure</a> is set in Ysyr. It's pretty good, so I recommend it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds cool, I will take a look, thank you!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385415-ysyr-fan-write-ups?p=1385580#post1385580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My write up is woefully out of date, considering it's point of reference was Assyria, and Ys is more...Imperial France meets Melnebione meets Carthage.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't mind, do you have a link?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-29T21:22:38-07:00","id":1458016,"title":"","content":"Just throwing in a bump here again over a year later, is anyone aware of fan made Ysyr fan write ups?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-29T22:57:59-07:00","id":1458022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385415-ysyr-fan-write-ups?p=1385580#post1385580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My write up is woefully out of date, considering it's point of reference was Assyria, and Ys is more...Imperial France meets Melnebione meets Carthage.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm most curious indeed about what combination of setting elements in the books might have led you to that conclusion (as i'd definitely enjoy taking a look at them myself).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385415-ysyr-fan-write-ups?p=1458016#post1458016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just throwing in a bump here again over a year later, is anyone aware of fan made Ysyr fan write ups?</div> </div> </div> </div>Never explored them in my own games, so unfortunately nothing to add on them - for the moment, at least.<br /> <br /> In fact rereading the corebook i just noticed i had mistakenly confused/mashed them up with bits from Palanquin AND Volivat. Duh. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Now </b>i can definitely see some slight shades of Moorcock's Melnibone or Granbretan, with stronger ones of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fomorians\" target=\"_blank\">Fomoire</a> or a post-apocalyptic enlightened/pure elite amidst mutated masses mixed in. Possibly also a twist on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mens_sana_in_corpore_sano\" target=\"_blank\">the saying about healthy minds &amp; bodies</a>, in that those native with more immaculate - and manicured - physiques possibly hide the greatest ambitions, vanity and hubris among them all.<br /> <br /> There's also the mystery of the sorcerous engines beneath the city and its Essence emanations - what purpose did or do they still serve, what exactly is going wrong with them, is it stable or a ticking bomb edging ever closer to the end of its countdown and how much do the Ys people actually know of this defunct relic of older times they exhumed and turned into the heart of their nation? I can also see something of Las Vegas in it, a place where masses hunker hungrily around an enviroment less wholesome than admited by all, for the sake of the dream of scoring in that one big gamble that will rise them from poverty &amp; physical to the greatest heights of success, prosperity and power.<br /> <br /> Just my musings &amp; ramblings of the moment. Time will tell what i can make or not out of it all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 08-30-2021, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-31T00:11:10-07:00","id":1458107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385415-ysyr-fan-write-ups?p=1458022#post1458022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'm most curious indeed about what combination of setting elements in the books might have led you to that conclusion (as i'd definitely enjoy taking a look at them myself).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Never explored them in my own games, so unfortunately nothing to add on them - for the moment, at least.<br /> <br /> In fact rereading the corebook i just noticed i had mistakenly confused/mashed them up with bits from Palanquin AND Volivat. Duh. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Now </b>i can definitely see some slight shades of Moorcock's Melnibone or Granbretan, with stronger ones of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fomorians\" target=\"_blank\">Fomoire</a> or a post-apocalyptic enlightened/pure elite amidst mutated masses mixed in. Possibly also a twist on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mens_sana_in_corpore_sano\" target=\"_blank\">the saying about healthy minds &amp; bodies</a>, in that those native with more immaculate - and manicured - physiques possibly hide the greatest ambitions, vanity and hubris among them all.<br /> <br /> There's also the mystery of the sorcerous engines beneath the city and its Essence emanations - what purpose did or do they still serve, what exactly is going wrong with them, is it stable or a ticking bomb edging ever closer to the end of its countdown and how much do the Ys people actually know of this defunct relic of older times they exhumed and turned into the heart of their nation? I can also see something of Las Vegas in it, a place where masses hunker hungrily around an enviroment less wholesome than admited by all, for the sake of the dream of scoring in that one big gamble that will rise them from poverty &amp; physical to the greatest heights of success, prosperity and power.<br /> <br /> Just my musings &amp; ramblings of the moment. Time will tell what i can make or not out of it all.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/964681-sorcerous-ysyr-in-detail\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/964681-sorcerous-ysyr-in-detail\"> Sorcerous Ysyr in Detail - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/964681-sorcerous-ysyr-in-detail\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/964681-sorcerous-ysyr-in-detail </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So. Ysyr. Cool place. Sorcerers that rule an empire of mutants. They have magic golems and other crazy stuff. Their capital is on top of an ancient Manse. Radical </div> </div> </div><br /> here ya go","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"http